mfg/specs/v6-refresh-notes.md:52:Flange 6.9 and stiffener 6.4 x 6.4 x 0.075 (body, joystick-nub, band-flex-tails); motor angle per size; protection circuit start per size; floor slot bottom per size; joystick angle per size. The cover glass and main-board pages needed no change against 17.25 to 17.27 (main-board.md:58 only).
mfg/specs/v6-refresh-notes.md:57:- The joystick-nub.md and body.md STEP and drawing status lines are not changed.
mfg/specs/v6-refresh-notes.md:61:Run from the project root: `design/.venv/bin/python design/mfg/assembly/check_assembly.py`, before my edits exit 0 and after my edits exit 0, last lines "E1 PASS all 225 distinct path:line citations open", "RESULT PASS". No cited line of body.md, band-liner.md, joystick-nub.md, main-board.md, cover-glass.md or band-flex-tails.md moved: I kept every cited line in place (body.md:3, 5, 83, 90, 93, 117; band-liner.md:15, 28, 34, 37, 43, 45, 48, 50 checked after the edits) and put new rows and sections after them. Old and new line numbers: none moved. The meaning of a few cited lines changed only in wording (body.md:90 and band-liner.md:15, 50).
mfg/specs/v7-refresh-notes.md:3:Basis: architecture 17.29 (round joystick, gloss black finish) and 17.30 (no recording light); exterior report `design/look/s1/merged32h-report.md`; parts list `design/bom.csv` at v7 (read, not edited); the lead's fixed choices for CAP1, FRM1, the glass print and the board hole. No git command was run.
