mfg/specs/v7-refresh-notes.md:8:- `design/mfg/specs/main-board.md`: light guide hole row and LED1 row replaced by "holes through the board: 0"; open point 10 closed; note that the v6.2 STEP still has the hole.
mfg/specs/v7-refresh-notes.md:10:- `design/mfg/specs/band-liner.md`, `band-flex-tails.md`: "nub" became "cap CAP1"; "light end" became "hand end".
