mfg/specs/v7-refresh-notes.md:12:- `design/mfg/parts-notes.md`, `design/mfg/mfg-notes.md`: v7 banner; the v6.2 files for the light parts, the rectangular joystick and the board hole are marked removed in v7 and not to be made.
